<title>THAILAND: Bank of Ayudhya unaudited 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ayudhya unaudited 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		11.42	 vs	 11.19</p>
<p>    Net		    5,029.62	 vs    4,476.97</p>
<p>Notes: Fourth quarter figures not stated. Bank of Ayudhya Plc is a major Thai bank.</p>
